Subject: Time direct tail transfers at instruction boundaries

Support direct JML in selected instruction timing. Preserve the guest return
frame, commit clocks and PB, and check events at the destination before
either tier executes. Compare same-bank and cross-bank complete and suspended
executions against the real interpreter.

Co-authored-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>

